       }
      ],
      "text": "Role in DI:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " central DI: desmopressin = the preparation of choice (adults and children); antidiuresis lasts 12 to 24 h; intranasal, PO, SC or IV."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
